KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ spaceship-synthesis builtin parses: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Passes trivially where the system preprocessor lacks the builtin
(clang <= 21, gcc); FAILS with a parse error in an archlinux/clang-22
container, where libc++'s default_three_way_comparator.h also breaks.
Fix direction: lex the builtin as a binary type predicate
(TOK_BINARY_TYPE_PREDICATE family in scanner.l).
